Cell[TextData[{
 "Similarly for F. ",
 "But, since we are identifying under so(2), which is E \[Dash] F, on the \
functions of interest, the action of E and F is the same. So we ",
 StyleBox["don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t need to consider group elements generated \
by F",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". ",
 "\n\nH, on the other hand, is diagonal and powers of it are not zero:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9143028001313343`*^9, 3.914302802100647*^9}, {
  3.914302833377288*^9, 3.914302862922208*^9}, {3.914311421158349*^9, 
