Cell["\<\
acts on the upper half plane as a fractional linear transformation. In \
particular it maps the point \[ImaginaryI] as follows:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9143873479158497`*^9, 3.914387379335762*^9}, {
  3.914387712652965*^9, 
  3.9143877149276037`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"243bd987-e0ca-4466-a4d4-\
6ff3c03e53f0"],

