Cell["\<\
(Note: the order is important! I\[CloseCurlyQuote]m following Garrett p.12, \
putting n m, i.e E, H.)
We get (note the order is {E,F,H}, and x[1] goes with E, x[3] goes with H):\
\>", "Text",
