Cell["\<\
(I haven\[CloseCurlyQuote]t checked how this relates to Garrett\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s calculation on p.12, looks like it should be equivalent. \
If you are really interested, go ahead and check that! He puts an extra \
action on the right, and differentiaties with respect to it.)\
\>", "Text",
